# Terraform (infra/terraform/cloudflare). State is local: it holds the owner's email (OPS-014).
# .terraform.lock.hcl is committed on purpose; a saved plan holds the same values as state.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
!*.tfvars.example
